  "description": "Pure WF4 capability. Evaluates completion_note length and evidence_refs against pressure_score and config. High-pressure completions without evidence return needs_evidence.\n\nImplemented and smoke-tested matrix (use_cases):\n- pass with evidence under high pressure\n- needs_evidence verdict when evidence is missing under high pressure\n- invalid_status when status is not done/completed\n- invalid_input when item.id is empty\n\nKnown limitations (intentional in 1.0.1):\n- reason_code config_error removed; the guest does not emit that code\n- Evidence quality is presence-only; content is not validated",
